// The debug world's free camera: the standard's (../standard/free-camera.puck) for the debug world's one local seat.
// Imported ahead of the board game room's tables, so the camera body takes the population's highest slot and every other
// body keeps its index (debug.puck adds `freeCameraBodies` to the capacity). F9 toggles it. It rests 40 m over the stage,
// an overview of the caldera, until a seat first flies it.
import "../standard/inputs"
import "../standard/free-camera"

freeCamera(seats: freeCameraBodies)
